= Envoys from Raxus

[+ threat_leader +] of the Rimward Coalition has been meeting envoys from Raxus. The Coalition's worlds have waited generations for the Core to listen to them, and Count Dooku is listening now. In the corridors, Coalition senators talk openly of crossing the floor to the Separatist Caucus.
